==Trivia==
Tyranitar is one of eight Pokémon in the {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} expansion to feature a {{TCGP|Link Ability}} that is active or usable while {{TCGP|Arceus|Arceus or Arceus ex}} is in play. All of these cards, along with {{TCG ID|Triumphant Light|Arceus|70}} and {{TCG ID|Triumphant Light|Arceus ex|71}} from the same expansion, have a special pattern behind the card text to symbolise their connection to Arceus and are part of the [[Triumphant Light (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]] "Pokémon with Abilities that "Link" with Arceus".

===Origin===
*'''Land Crush''' is an attack that first appeared as '''Fissure''' on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Brock's Golem|20}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

